   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">a young family of four sit at the dining table and eat pizza and salad.Mum helps her little girl with her meal , as she cheekily stuffs a whole tomato into her mouth .</rdf:li>
